# Onderon, the ruined Merchant Quarter and the Sky Ramp (TSL, 511OND,
# 504OND, 506OND): the Basilisk landed among Vaklu's troops (the Royalist
# soldier's alarm, Mandalore pleased), the troops fought, Captain Bostuco's
# word that the Sky Ramp is overrun and Talia, Kavar and Kadron's scene in
# the Palace; up the Sky Ramp: the first platform's troopers, the barracks
# retaken (the Royalist Sergeant sends two men after the Exile), the Turret
# Control Tower's console (Bostuco's access code, the lower force shield
# deactivated), the troopers at the shield told to surrender, Bostuco on
# the second shield, the fleeing cowards let go ("I will not harm you if
# you leave now"), the damaged upper shield bashed through, the Sith Lords
# and turrets at the top, into the Royal Palace.
# Starts from the Basilisk's landing:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @onderon_civil_war data/routes/tsl/finale_sky_ramp.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Onderon Civil War" and "The Sky Ramp";
# GameBanshee 48 and 51 (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the tower's turret minigame (term_acc's "Control the turret.",
# 505OND, eight ships), the barracks' lockers and workbench, the power
# conductors (xterm1, xterm2: they blow up on the party).
#
# ASSUMES:
# - The party is the Exile, Kreia and Mandalore (ro_sold's E4 is Mandalore's
#   line; without him R1 goes on to E6 anyway).
# - The Royalist soldier's alarm (ro_sold) starts itself: k_511_enter has
#   ond_soldier_nter start it.
# - Bostuco's scenes in 511OND (cs_tal_3 starts 1, 2, 3) play at
#   tr_cs_tal_3; Bostuco then runs ahead to the Sky Ramp.
# - 511OND's To_504 links From_510OND, which 504OND does not have: the
#   arrival falls back on 504OND's entry (78.7, 16.2), by From_502OND.
# - The Royalist Sergeant (RepSold, ro_brck start 0) answers a use; his
#   E4 needs Bostuco along (c_local_notset). # UNSURE: he may speak first.
# - door_tower is Locked (DC 28 in its template). # UNSURE: what unlocks it
#   on the Queen's side (ro_brck's a_royal_play, or Bostuco); if it stays
#   shut, `bash ffield_lower` (its OnOpen a_bash_ff) instead of the console,
#   as DSimpson's second way ("go up to the Force Field with a Lightsaber").
# - term_acc start 0 (c_local_notset and c_global_eq) offers Bostuco's code;
#   once in (start 1), "Deactivate forceshield barrier." (a_kill_barrier).
# - ffield_upper (KeyRequired, Locked, no OnOpen) gives way to a bash:
#   Bostuco: "You might be able to bash your way through it with your
#   lightsaber." # UNSURE: the engine's bash on a force field door.
# - Bao-Dur is on Dxun, so 000ffield's "Maybe Bao-Dur could destroy it"
#   (c_npc_inprty false) is only a line.
say The Mandalorian exploits have left a profound impact # ro_sold, Mandalore
talk                 # "A Basilisk? A Basilisk here?" (k_511_enter)
fight 40             # Vaklu's troops in the Merchant Quarter
to tr_cs_tal_3       # Bostuco; Talia, Kavar and Kadron in the Palace (cs_tal_3)
talk
talk                 # "This way, this way to the Sky Ramp!"
exit To_504
module 504ond
to tr_trooper1       # ro_trp1: "A Jedi... here? Men, attack!"
talk
fight 40
use door_barrack     # the barracks (k_barrack_open)
fight 30
use RepSold          # ro_brck: "Hold your fire, they're with us!"; two follow
use door_tower       # the Turret Control Tower # UNSURE: locked, see above
fight 30             # the tower's troops
say Enter Bostuco's access code. # term_acc start 0
say Deactivate forceshield barrier. # (not "Access Turret Control.")
use term_acc
to tr_trooper2       # ro_trp2 at the lower shield
say Surrender now. Why lose your life for General Vaklu's ambitions?
talk
fight 40
to tr_bost_2         # Bostuco: the second force shield, damaged
talk
fight 40             # the mines and the ramp's troopers
say I will not harm you if you leave now. # ro_trp3: the cowards let go
to tr_trooper3
talk
fight 40             # the Sith Lord who cut them down, his line
bash ffield_upper    # the damaged upper force shield # UNSURE: see above
fight 40
to tr_officer_3      # the top platform: Sith Lords and turrets
fight 40
exit To_506
module 506ond
save onderon_royal_palace
